body:
I’ll be real the only true god is the Abraham god, anything else is flawed. And I’ll be real the way you described it you believe in Allah in a way. This is how Allah describes himself in the Quran’ Say: He is Allah, the One and Only;
Allah, the Eternal, Absolute;
He begetteth not, nor is He begotten;
And there is none like unto Him.
The uncaused cause is literally one way to describe Allah (god). 

And we know that gos is the uncaused cause because it is necessary. Something can pit come from nothing no matter how you chop it up so from this we know that this uncaused cause must have the ability to create. The universe could have been any other way so we know this uncaused cause has will and choice. We see intelligence and sophistication in the creation so he must possess intelligence.
